/*
SUBJECT: SmartLiving, a resident + security + estate app for Malaysian gated townships (Greenwood).
AUDIENCE: developers, JMBs and estate managers. JOB: let them play the app, then ask for a quote.
WORLD ARTIFACT: the guardhouse boom gate + laminated VISITOR pass + black Malaysian number plate.
TYPE: Roboto Slab 700/800 (signage) · Roboto (text) · Roboto Mono bold (plates, codes).
COLOR: rainforest green #184948 (lead ground) · ink #022a2a · brass #c08e39 (house-number accent)
       · barrier rust #944839 (boom arm + SOS only) · concrete #eef1ec bg. No navy/emerald glass.
LAYOUT: green hero with a live gatehouse scene across its foot → split demo (module list | phone)
       → asymmetric feature bento → before/after → savings calculator → FAQ → closing gate CTA.
SIGNATURE: the boom gate lifting for a matched plate; the same arm lifts inside the app.
*/
